==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|на-|стро́ить}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|настро́ить}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-настроить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|настро́ить|pf|impf=настра́ивать}}

# {{lb|ru|colloquial|perfective only}} to [[build]] {{+obj|ru|acc/gen<houses, buildings, etc. in quantity>}}
# {{lb|ru|music}} to [[tune]] (a musical instrument)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''настра́ивать''' [[роя́ль]]|'''to tune up''' a grand piano}}
# {{lb|ru|radio|television}} to [[tune]] (a radio or television)
# to [[put]], to [[cause]] to [[be]] {{+obj|ru|acc<someone> + :на(acc)<in a specified mood>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''настра́ивать''' [[жена|жену́]] [[в]] [[свой|свою́]] [[польза|по́льзу]]|to win over one's wife|lit=to '''cause''' one's wife to be in one's favor}}
# to [[incite]] {{+obj|ru|acc<someone> + :про́тив(gen)<against someone>}}

